corrections_draft/*/*_evidence.jsonl

# external dictionary sources NOT in csl-orig (e.g. PD = Deccan College Encyclopaedic
# Dictionary, CC BY-NC-SA, ~55 MB). Fetched with detectors/get_external_source.py;
# never committed here -- this repo hosts QA tooling + do-not-file lists, not dict text.
external_src/

# GRETIL kavya corpus (CC BY-NC-SA, third-party verse text) -- same "don't
# commit external source text" rule as external_src/ above. Fetched by
# detectors/meter/README.md's corpus-fetch step; the derived meter index
# (meter_verdicts.jsonl, also regenerable, ~1hr offline build) is likewise
# not committed -- see detectors/meter/build_meter_index.py.
detectors/gretil_kavya_raw/
detectors/gretil_pilot_raw/
detectors/gretil_*_raw/
detectors/meter/meter_verdicts.jsonl
detectors/meter/meter_verdicts_*.jsonl
detectors/meter/*.jsonl.bak
detectors/meter/*.log
# H289: the enlarged meter_check corroboration index (regenerable from the .jsonl
# indices via meter_check.py --verdicts=meter_verdicts_all.jsonl) is a large
# intermediate; the small curated deliverables (SECTIONS_DATASET.md,
# MULTISECTION_ERROR_CANDIDATES.md + .tsv, ngram_typos_*.tsv) ARE committed.
detectors/meter/meter_suspects_all*.txt

